<NoteLayout
  slug="config-reference"
  description="GH-600 configuration reference: custom agent profiles, custom instructions, agent skills, copilot-setup-steps.yml, repository and custom-agent MCP configuration, hooks, GitHub Agentic Workflows frontmatter, Copilot CLI flags and slash commands, and the GitHub Actions building blocks that gate agents."
  intro="GH-600 shows you configuration files and asks what they do, what is missing or what is unsafe. This page collects the syntax of every file and flag the skill pages rely on, with the properties and defaults that questions tend to hinge on."
>
